ain","alt_titles":["Моя судьба злодея","Eu Sou o Vilão Predestinado","The Villain of Destiny","Villain Is Here","我！天命大反派","악역이지만 즐겁습니다","El Villano del Destino","Ta Trời Sinh Đã Là Nhân Vật Phản Diện","我こそは大悪党","Me! The Heavenly Destined Villain","Me, the Heavenly Destined Villain","Wo! Tianming Da Fanpai","Ta! Thiên Mệnh Đại Phản Phái","Je suis le grand méchant prédestiné","¡Yo soy el Villano Destinado!","Eu Sou o Vilão Destinado","Aku Adalah Penjahat yang Ditakdirkan","Kha Khue Tua Rai Tam Chokchata","Я сужденный злодей","أنا الشرير المقدر","ข้าคือตัวร้ายตามโชคชะตา"],"description":"\u003cp\u003eImmediately after Gu Changge realized he had transgressed into a fantasy world, the world's protagonist, and fortune's chosen, vowed to take revenge on him. Envied by all, he not only has the female lead head over heels for him but he's also treated as a distinguished guest wherever he goes. Fortunately, Gu Changge's prestige and power are superior to everyone else's, so shouldn’t it be easy to trample on a mere fortune's chosen? Hold on... There's a system dedicated to milking and harvesting from the protagonist? Gu Changge smirked. \"Seems like even fate wants me to fulfill my destiny as the Villain of this world!”.\u003c/p\u003e","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/i-am-the-fated-villain.e8d6b3.webp","status":"ongoing","type":"manhua","author":"天命反派","artist":"Kuaikan","popularity_rank":62,"bookmark_count":51268,"rating":9.237196765498652,"chapter_count":370,"last_chapter_at":"2026-11-18T08:32:01.755216Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:42.447559Z","public_url":"/comics/i-am-the-fated-villain-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1911","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":24,"name":"Isekai","slug":"isekai"},{"id":34,"name":"Murim","slug":"murim"},{"id":63,"name":"System","slug":"system"},{"id":72,"name":"Villain","slug":"villain"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":263331,"